Core/Jessie: Some of these things look… different. More overgrown than others.
Core/Rose: That’s the infection progressing. Early stage, you might just see vines on the skin.
Core/Rose: Later…
Core/Jessie: Later?
Core/Rose: Branches. Flowers. Full integration with the plant matter.
Core/Jessie: Can they still think? At that point?
Core/Rose: I don’t know. I don’t think so. But they still hunt.
Core/Jessie: That’s somehow worse.